# vcoutreach settings.
#
# Copy this file to .env and edit the copy. .env is git-ignored: never commit it
# and never paste a real key into this example file.
#
# Rules for the file:
# - One KEY=VALUE per line, quotes optional, a leading "export " is accepted.
# - Put comments on their own lines, not after a value.
# - A line that is not KEY=VALUE is skipped with a warning that names the line
#   number and never shows the value.
# - A real environment variable always wins over the same name in .env.
#
# This repository's .gitignore covers .env, drafts/, .vcoutreach/ and
# contacts*.csv only. Name your real contact list contacts.csv, or add your own
# ignore line for whatever name you use.
#
# Nothing here is needed for offline mode:
#   vcoutreach draft --contacts contacts.sample.csv --sender sender.sample.json --offline

# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Personalization provider: Publik API (the default when a key is present)
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Your Publik API key. Get one at https://publikhq.com/dashboard/api and follow
# the page. API calls cost real money per the Publik pricing page.
# Leave empty to stay offline or to use another provider.
PUBLIK_API_KEY=

# Base URL of the Publik API. Trailing slashes are ignored.
PUBLIK_API_BASE_URL=https://publikhq.com/api/v1

# Model name. One of: publik-fast, publik-balanced, publik-smart, publik-default.
PUBLIK_MODEL=publik-balanced

# Seconds to wait for each request before giving up.
PUBLIK_TIMEOUT_SECONDS=30

# Extra attempts after a timeout, a connection error, 429, or a 5xx response.
PUBLIK_MAX_RETRIES=3

# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Personalization provider: bring your own key
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------

# OpenAI-compatible provider (any server with an OpenAI-style /chat/completions).
# Your provider bills you directly. Leave the key empty to disable.
OPENAI_API_KEY=
OPENAI_BASE_URL=https://api.openai.com/v1
# Model name to request. There is no default: this is required whenever
# OPENAI_API_KEY is set. Without it, vcoutreach stops with an error.
OPENAI_MODEL=

# Anthropic provider. Your provider bills you directly. Leave the key empty to disable.
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
# Model name to request. There is no default: this is required whenever
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY is set. Without it, vcoutreach stops with an error.
ANTHROPIC_MODEL=

# With --provider auto (the default), vcoutreach picks the first configured one of:
# publik, openai, anthropic. If none has a key, it falls back to the offline
# template provider, prints a warning to stderr ("no provider key found ...
# placeholder hooks"), and still exits 0. --offline and --provider template
# choose the template provider on purpose and print no warning.

# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Optional: sending with Gmail (off by default, see the README before enabling)
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------

# "test" routes every message to TEST_RECIPIENT_EMAIL instead of the real recipient.
# "live" is only honored when every live condition in the README is met.
# Any other value is an error. Keep this at test unless you are sure.
SEND_MODE=test

# Your own inbox. Needed only to run "send --execute" in test mode. A plan-only
# run (no --execute) works without it, but if you set it, it must be one valid
# address even in plan mode.
TEST_RECIPIENT_EMAIL=

# The From address used when sending (the Gmail account you authorize).
SENDER_EMAIL=

# Maximum live sends per UTC day.
DAILY_SEND_CAP=20

# Base directory for local working files. The send journal and its lock file are
# written under <WORKDIR>/.vcoutreach/, which is git-ignored. Default is the
# current directory.
# WORKDIR=.

# Where the Gmail OAuth token and your OAuth client file live. Defaults shown.
# The token file is created with owner-only permissions. Never commit either file.
# GMAIL_TOKEN_PATH=~/.config/vcoutreach/token.json
# GMAIL_CLIENT_SECRETS_PATH=~/.config/vcoutreach/client_secret.json
